[00:10.000 – 00:15.000] Close on {S2_APRON} alone in the warm kitchen. She looks down at the plate of ribs, then slowly unties her apron, folds it neatly over the counter, and lets out a breath that is half laugh and half relief. Hold on her face as the frame settles.

overall_soundscape:
Footsteps on a corridor floor, a swing door settling on its hinge, a soft exhale, the low hum of an empty kitchen. One short line of Chinese dialogue.

non_diegetic_music:
The theme resolves fully, warm and plain, then fades to quiet.""",
